{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat Mechanics / Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The core combat is built around Super Armor Break.</strong><br>Precise parries, well-timed dodges, and dealing damage all build energy, which can be unleashed at the right moment to interrupt enemy attacks and gradually take control of the fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers multiple offensive options, including high-risk techniques that deliver equally high rewards when used with proper judgment and execution, resulting in impactful and satisfying combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/a404149de33f3ee0d761bc929a55ac2a.poster.avif?t=1768943815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/a404149de33f3ee0d761bc929a55ac2a.webm?t=1768943815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/a404149de33f3ee0d761bc929a55ac2a.mp4?t=1768943815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/4c5cb987a4f10aae3132de5c52c4ad20.poster.avif?t=1768943815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/4c5cb987a4f10aae3132de5c52c4ad20.webm?t=1768943815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/4c5cb987a4f10aae3132de5c52c4ad20.mp4?t=1768943815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows a <strong>linear narrative structure</strong>, with the journey unfolding along a fixed timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players move through several distinct yet interconnected stages, transitioning from light, pure moments to increasingly complex and oppressive confrontations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changes in environments, characters, and gameplay form an allegorical journey of growth and transformation.<br>Certain meanings are never stated outright, and are instead left for players to interpret through their own experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/f926cbd9d2e36915679710993cc3a1a6.avif?t=1768943815\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras_big/f926cbd9d2e36915679710993cc3a1a6.webp?t=1768943815 width=1560 height=877 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/48febcdc704668d1a4b0eaa462ae189b.avif?t=1768943815\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras_big/48febcdc704668d1a4b0eaa462ae189b.avif?t=1768943815 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before You Buy </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed by a single creator and offers a focused, tightly crafted experience, prioritizing the journey over sheer length.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833600?t=1768943815","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833600?t=1768943815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/f84e15b26184f1792fa5e8b9cb20816ec7e00b5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768943815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.stea